# ── Offline doc mirrors (wget) ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Heavy raw HTML host trees (~90% boilerplate) — ignored at any depth.
# The lean Markdown distilled from them lives in docs/api/<topic>/_md/ and is
# intentionally NOT ignored: that is the reference the agent actually reads.
# Regenerate _md/ with: python pinky-workspace/scripts/mirror_to_md.py
**/docs/api/*/*.com/
**/docs/api/*/*.io/

# ── Python build artifacts ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
dist/
build/
*.egg-info/
htmlcov/
coverage.xml

# ── Virtualenvs ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
env/

# ── macOS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
